# ZeroS: replaces MindTheGapps' gapps.rc in the Google build (bug B10).
# Keeps ro.com.google.gmsversion, copied from MindTheGapps' file at the pinned
# commit (update it whenever the vendor/gapps pin moves). Leaves out
# ro.opa.eligible_device: with it, Google's setup offers the Assistant step,
# whose screen belongs to the Google app that ZeroS leaves out, and setup
# stalls on a blank screen.
on init
    setprop ro.com.google.gmsversion 17_202606
